message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Strategy Showdown: side-by-side backtests of publicly documented trading algorithms"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Norman
    given-names: Aleksander
license: MIT
version: 0.3.0
date-released: "2026-10-04"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Normansrule/strategy-showdown"
url: "https://normansrule.github.io/strategy-showdown/"
abstract: >-
  An open-source educational website and local desktop mode that backtests publicly documented
  trading algorithms under identical conditions and reports honest metrics (costs, deflated Sharpe
  ratios, factor attribution). Every parameter is traced to its published source.
keywords:
  - backtesting
  - quantitative finance
  - education
  - reproducibility
  - momentum
